  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Assistance to IDPs and Congolese refugees in Tombura-Yambio diocese</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD have been requested to provide urgent assistance to the Tombura-Yambio diocese so that they may provide assistance to increasing numbers of refugees and IDPs fleeing the DRC / Sudan border area where the LRA have reportedly resumed brutal attacks. Thousands of people are reported to have been displaced. While some have found their way to refugee camps others are being absorbed into South Sudan communities where the host populations are struggling to cope.

This grant is intended to help the diocese provide emergency assistance in the form of NFI distributions to people who are extremely traumatized, hungry and soaking wet because of the rain.</narrative>
  </description>
